{2}╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮{R}
{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Manage the host-side otter export index                 {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter exp     <list|rebuild|prune|delete> [options]{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter exports <list|rebuild|prune|delete> [options]{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter exports list{R}                                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter exports rebuild{R}                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter exports prune --root{R}                              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter exports delete ~/.local/bin/htop-box{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Commands:{R}                                               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}list{R}        {2}┆{R} {4}ls{R}  {5}Show all recorded exports{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}rebuild{R}     {2}┆{R}     {5}Rebuild index from ownership markers{R}   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}prune{R}       {2}┆{R}     {5}Drop stale records, orphans, artifacts{R} {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}delete{R}      {2}┆{R} {4}rm{R}  {5}Delete one export by absolute path{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--scan-path{R} {2}┆{R}     {5}Extra path to scan (rebuild, prune){R}    {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                                 {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}      {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Include rootful owners (prune){R}         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}      {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}                 {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Index lives in ~/.local/share/otter/exports/index/{R}       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Ownership is absolute: only the owning tuple is touched.{R} {2}│{R}
{2}╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯{R}
